A dune rule gives `styled-ppx.generate` the library's `.cmt` files next to
its `.pp.ml` files, so the sheet follows the modules' imports. `Alpha`
imports `Zeta`, so `Zeta`'s block comes first, although `alpha` sorts first
by path. The same rule works for a native library (`byte/*.cmt`) and a
Melange library (`melange/*.cmt`; dune 3.24 and later keep a Melange
library's preprocessed files in `.melange_src/`). The libraries are
wrapped, so the alias module's `.cmt` (compiled from a generated file) is
skipped.

  $ cat > dune-project << EOF
  > (lang dune 3.10)
  > (using melange 0.1)
  > EOF

  $ mkdir native js
  $ cat > native/zeta.re << EOF
  > let base = [%css "color: red"];
  > EOF
  $ cat > native/alpha.re << EOF
  > let card = [%css "color: blue"];
  > let _ = Zeta.base;
  > EOF
  $ cp native/zeta.re native/alpha.re js/

  $ cat > native/dune << EOF
  > (library
  >  (name lib)
  >  (libraries styled-ppx.native)
  >  (preprocess
  >   (pps styled-ppx --native)))
  > (rule
  >  (target styles.css)
  >  (deps
  >   (glob_files_rec ./**.pp.ml)
  >   (glob_files .lib.objs/byte/*.cmt))
  >  (action
  >   (run styled-ppx.generate --output %{target} %{deps})))
  > EOF

  $ cat > js/dune << EOF
  > (library
  >  (name lib_js)
  >  (modes melange)
  >  (libraries styled-ppx.melange)
  >  (preprocess
  >   (pps styled-ppx melange.ppx)))
  > (rule
  >  (target styles.css)
  >  (deps
  >   (glob_files *.pp.ml)
  >   (glob_files .melange_src/*.pp.ml)
  >   (glob_files .lib_js.objs/melange/*.cmt))
  >  (action
  >   (run styled-ppx.generate --output %{target} %{deps})))
  > EOF

  $ dune build native/styles.css js/styles.css
  $ cat _build/default/native/styles.css
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually; libraries: lib */
  .css-osk137y{color:red;}
  .css-ms44cav{color:blue;}
  $ diff _build/default/native/styles.css _build/default/js/styles.css
  1c1
  < /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually; libraries: lib */
  ---
  > /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually; libraries: lib_js */
  [1]

Without the `.cmt` files, the order is the path order:

  $ styled-ppx.generate _build/default/native/zeta.re.pp.ml _build/default/native/alpha.re.pp.ml
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually; libraries: lib */
  .css-ms44cav{color:blue;}
  .css-osk137y{color:red;}
